        a: 'Expect 15 to 30 percent below list price as a baseline for enterprise software deals, with deeper discounts available in competitive situations, at fiscal quarter end, or in exchange for multi-year commitments. Organizations that accept initial proposals without negotiating typically overpay by 20 to 40 percent relative to market price for equivalent terms.'
